cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "quiet-vivobook: closed-loop thermal control, and the arithmetic behind the seven-figure fan-savings claim"
abstract: >-
  A closed-loop thermal controller for a machine that exposes no fan
  telemetry, together with an independent audit of the fan-power and
  thermal-cycling economics it is used to justify. Every published number
  is labelled measured, simulated, public or assumed.
